  "description": "Every producer that builds a sheet or view `source` (or a `sources[]` fan-out entry) sets `industry` as a non-empty string \u2014 never an object, never dropped, and never placed outside `source` where the server's record whitelist silently drops it. A sheet saved before this change is backfilled at load time: `source.dataset` with no `source.industry` gets `industry = dataset` and gains an empty `sources: []`.",
