        "dataset": "Banking",
        "datasetLabel": "Banking",
        "industry": {
          "label": "Banking"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "why": "every sources[] entry must carry industry alongside dataset/label; an entry missing it cannot be resolved against the registry and openability() would silently treat it as unaddressed",
      "payload": [
        {
          "dataset": "Credit Union",
          "label": "Credit Union"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "source.industry must be a non-empty string; an empty string is indistinguishable from 'never set' and must be rejected the same as a missing key, not accepted as a valid (if blank) industry",
      "payload": {
        "label": "Banking",
        "reportName": "Banking Industry Spending Overview.xlsx",
